  - m_Id: 296236889440256
    m_Localized: 'Analytics: ON'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296236948160512
    m_Localized: 'Analytics: OFF'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296236948160513
    m_Localized: Anonymous gameplay data
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296236948160514
    m_Localized: Help us balance the game? We send anonymous gameplay data (combats,
      gold, combos). No personal data. You can change this anytime from the menu.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296236948160515
    m_Localized: Accept
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296236948160516
    m_Localized: Decline
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 296236948160517
    m_Localized: Privacy policy
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 878601589063680
    m_Localized: Language
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 878601672949760
    m_Localized: Are you sure?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 878601672949761
    m_Localized: Back
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211500024659968
    m_Localized: Contract
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1211500091768832
    m_Localized: Minimum damage = highest die
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2019786932191232
    m_Localized: 'Your dice:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2019786974134272
    m_Localized: 'Choose the selected die''s slot:'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2019786974134273
    m_Localized: Slot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2019786974134274
    m_Localized: slots
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2019786974134275
    m_Localized: Enchantment
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 2019786974134276
    m_Localized: Confirm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251619241984
    m_Localized: Click a tile to move. Walk to the highlighted door to leave the
      room.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905280
    m_Localized: Combat! This is your enemy. In the tutorial you always act first.
      (Click to continue.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905281
    m_Localized: 'Your hero fights in melee: you need to close the distance first.
      Select MOVE ({0}).'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905282
    m_Localized: The highlighted tiles are where you can reach this turn. Click a
      tile next to the enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905283
    m_Localized: "You ended up far from the enemy \u2014 and you can only move once
      per turn. Press END TURN ({0}) and let them come to you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905284
    m_Localized: 'This is your HEALTH: if it hits zero, the run is over. Look after
      it. (Click to continue.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905285
    m_Localized: 'This is your ENERGY: moving, attacking and rerolling dice all spend
      it. Manage it every turn. (Click to continue.)'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905286
    m_Localized: ATTACK ({0}) is unlocked. Select it to choose who to hit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905287
    m_Localized: 'First you pick the target: click the enemy highlighted in red.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905288
    m_Localized: 'Target locked! These are your dice: grab them by holding left click
      and throw them with a quick flick of the mouse.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905289
    m_Localized: "Build generala combos (pair, trio, straight...). Click a die to
      lock it and keep it. Want to reroll? Grab the dice you want to change and throw
      them again \u2014 you get up to 3 rolls. When you like the combo, press CONFIRM."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905290
    m_Localized: 'Hit landed! You had rolls left over from the attack, so the DEFENSE
      phase begins: grab and throw the dice to build a SHIELD that absorbs the next
      hit. Lock, reroll and CONFIRM your defense combo.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905291
    m_Localized: Attack complete! When there's nothing else you want to do, press
      END TURN ({0}) to hand the turn over to the enemy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905292
    m_Localized: "That's how you fight! Repeat the process \u2014 move, attack, build
      combos \u2014 until the enemy is down. (Click to continue.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905293
    m_Localized: 'You got hit! HEAL ({0}) is unlocked: use it on your turn when you''re
      low on health.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905294
    m_Localized: 'Healing uses the dice too: grab them with a held click, throw them
      and beat the threshold to recover health. Lock the high dice, reroll the rest
      if you need to, and confirm.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905295
    m_Localized: "Well done! Head through the highlighted door. The other one is
      locked \u2014 you'll open it later."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905296
    m_Localized: "There are too many of them! FORCE DOOR ({0}) is unlocked: use it
      to escape the way you came. It only works if you're next to a door \u2014 and
      right now you are."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905297
    m_Localized: 'Forcing the door is resolved with the dice: grab them, throw them
      and beat the threshold to escape the fight.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905298
    m_Localized: 'The room is unlocked: go in and finish what you started.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905299
    m_Localized: Now you're ready! With the PAIR upgrade you can take on both enemies.
      (Click to continue.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905300
    m_Localized: 'You escaped! The shop door is open. Head in: something that will
      give you the edge is waiting.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905301
    m_Localized: 'This is the shop. Walk up to the pedestal and press F to buy the
      upgrade: your PAIR combo will deal +50 damage.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905302
    m_Localized: 'Upgrade bought! Now you''re ready: head back the way you came and
      finish those enemies.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905303
    m_Localized: 'Excellent! Move on to the last room: the enchantment room.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905304
    m_Localized: 'This is the enchantment table: it upgrades one of your dice for
      gold, for the rest of the run. Walk up to the altar and press F to open it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905305
    m_Localized: "Pick one of your dice, pick the enchantment and confirm: the die
      stays upgraded for the rest of the run. The stronger the die, the more enchantment
      slots it has. Each enchantment costs gold \u2014 what you saved is enough for
      exactly ONE. (Click to continue.)"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905306
    m_Localized: "Die enchanted! You know everything you need \u2014 close the table."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905307
    m_Localized: Step through the highlighted door to begin your real adventure.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7800251719905308
    m_Localized: Click to continue
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 7867763907198976
    m_Localized: Coming soon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8159026612039680
    m_Localized: Reroll  -1 {ENERGY}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8159026649788416
    m_Localized: '{0} Roll  -1 {ENERGY}'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8187299979096064
    m_Localized: 'You have no free rolls left!

      Each additional roll costs
      1 Energy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8535671167614976
    m_Localized: These are your class dice. Click one to add it to your bag; the
      number on each row shows how many of that type you can carry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8535671486382080
    m_Localized: Your bag is built here, always sorted from lowest to highest. Click
      a die in the strip to send it back to the pool.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8535671486382081
    m_Localized: Clear empties the whole bag so you can start over.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 8535671486382082
    m_Localized: Once your bag is full, Confirm unlocks and starts the run.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
